stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Manifested: manifest closed
  Manifested --> AtDepot: first depot scan
  AtDepot --> InTransit: line-haul or carrier collection
  InTransit --> AtDepot: arrival scan
  InTransit --> OutForDelivery: loaded on van
  OutForDelivery --> Delivered: delivery scan or carrier delivered
  OutForDelivery --> AttemptFailed: no one home
  AttemptFailed --> OutForDelivery: next attempt
  AttemptFailed --> Returned: third failed attempt
  Manifested --> Stalled: no event for 48 hours
  AtDepot --> Stalled: no event for 48 hours
  InTransit --> Stalled: no event for 48 hours
  Stalled --> AtDepot: scan found
  Delivered --> [*]
  Returned --> [*]
  AtDepot: At depot
  InTransit: In transit
  OutForDelivery: Out for delivery
  AttemptFailed: Delivery attempted
